      "value": "What's even worse now than before is if I get a join request in a world that doesn't allow me to accept it, the notification will not actually tell me that. I can jus accept as per normal and they'll never get anything back, so most people will not even send you a response because they're not paying attention to the world type they're in and jus blindly click accept when they really can't do that.",
