      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d6ac3d319a45a329c545086|full_name}: yeah, one of the features I refered to seeing is actually the option to send back a message saying \"I'm in friends only, I can't invite\" which is a shit option for specifically that reason",
